msgctxt "92"
msgid "Let's try this place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Huh? How's this one any different from the one over there? They've all got "
"a bunch of hostesses who sit and drink with you, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Nah, man, this place has way more than that. This place has got pole "
"dancing! They're pretty big on keepin' their customers entertained, I "
"guess..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Look, let's just go in. You'll see what I mean once we're inside! Our time "
"has come, my friend! And if we're lucky, so will we!"
msgstr ""

